{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KsfParams","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"KsfParams","roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK9KsfParamsV","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KsfParams","kind":"identifier"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/KsfParams"},"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/ksfparams"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"The key-stretching function and cost a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/start"},{"text":" response names (CONTRACT.md §23.4).","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/SQ","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/s8SendableP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"]]},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KsfParams","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The cost properties are optional on purpose: they arrive flat, and a field that does not apply"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the named function is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"absent, not zero","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Reading a missing "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/KsfParams\/memoryKib"},{"type":"text","text":" as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"type":"text","text":" would"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stretch at the wrong cost and fail against a recor